              <l xml:id="m-3699a364-c5bd-4232-9d26-3d28e8b74254" facs="#m-efee05d3-a8a6-4429-a731-0294af0ac80d" label="ambiguous">December 7. 8.</l><l xml:id="m-f22c9ef6-b975-45b5-a0b2-663f82383bda" facs="#m-0f3fc3bd-660f-432c-aee6-a67d21efb0de" label="ambiguous">1313</l><l xml:id="m-01d7a074-2772-4db9-8ac3-3ff0952a49c2" facs="#m-3c788b66-85cc-42a1-a8a6-7ceba297decc" label="ambiguous">St. Ambrose. Bishop, Confessor,</l><l xml:id="m-6a7ea3f1-4c1c-4a40-b443-eb9097c562fa" facs="#m-6aa62577-d23e-424c-80ec-b276b134c41c" label="ambiguous">7.</l><l xml:id="m-4a9ce8fb-c324-400f-afac-d35cefa1c344" facs="#m-47fcfb93-6231-480d-874a-ad741ab4f16b" label="text-like">and Doctor of the Church.</l><l xml:id="m-532f82f1-457a-440d-8513-14675767bfda" facs="#m-7967e02a-07d1-41e4-bf6f-f7a5a97d6e47" label="ambiguous">Double.</l><l xml:id="m-b3b7ffad-8692-4cde-a1d4-1b76603b42cf" facs="#m-cd8e2e8b-625a-4932-95a0-841dae1c7c00" label="lyrics-like">At Ist and 2nd Vespers, at Magn. Ant. O Dóctor óptime... beá̂te</l><l xml:id="m-e1085415-6f8c-45e0-b05c-36313c75e1cd" facs="#m-a9c22138-5e9a-409d-93dc-434d39ee40d7" label="lyrics-like">Ambrósi. D. 262s.</l><l xml:id="m-a078be42-20c3-49f4-bfe0-6361b7e8e588" facs="#m-98a8ac6e-e3e4-4270-923e-f8e248974bde" label="text-like">At Mass.</l><l xml:id="m-ccfc8093-bdb0-4aca-ad5d-51121577302b" facs="#m-fe802b74-355e-4dbd-847d-44930c252aa1" label="lyrics-like">Introit. In médio. p. 1190.</l><l xml:id="m-2894edf9-5e2d-4ae3-a96b-7eca0d54a382" facs="#m-2f4468a9-0b13-4a7e-bbb4-a053a7e08660" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-82ae8e8b-86f7-469b-85f4-36113067385c" facs="#m-1426a59c-3041-4d96-bf06-43d68f4cbc79" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui pópulo tuo aetérnae! habúimus in terris, * intercessórem</l><l xml:id="m-9d552616-1cda-4405-987b-52430924ddd5" facs="#m-55ad2175-6550-448c-8595-53ddb755f0e5" label="lyrics-like">I salútis beátum Ambrósium mi-habére mereámur in caelis. Per</l><l xml:id="m-74100925-6e37-43a8-aa06-4381bc462749" facs="#m-45b8ffa2-b1ba-4f78-bd34-23baa41c5d0f" label="lyrics-like">nistrum tribuísti: t praesta, quaé¬ Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-b5e65925-390c-4ff8-b112-a45c5effab16" facs="#m-4ad269db-cc61-46b6-8a11-f71a4527812f" label="lyrics-like">sumus; ut quem Doctórem vitae</l><l xml:id="m-c6cbaaa9-b72c-4896-bb3e-9ede2d0c9781" facs="#m-6cb21b2c-3257-4dd6-bc99-494faa82ef13" label="lyrics-like">Epistle. Testíficor coram Deo. p. 1190.</l><l xml:id="m-1ac28473-107d-455a-831c-5ec4a3a369f8" facs="#m-bd31ea95-0890-4a8d-a9b4-49955eb7f065" label="lyrics-like">Gradual. Ecce sacérdos mágnus. p. 1183.</l><l xml:id="m-01a589c2-1e47-46c9-b6fb-7ae19fcb8f65" facs="#m-fb8d3df5-710a-450f-80c4-7397b63528dd" label="lyrics-like">Allelúia, allelúia. V. Jurávit. p. 1187.</l><l xml:id="m-8f227b21-a05f-4484-9e3c-b1ffebd89fe0" facs="#m-5e785c05-05f2-4b42-9b93-5d9fae568571" label="text-like">Gospel. Vos estis sal terrae. p. 1192. Credo. is said.</l><l xml:id="m-7817d85c-4ac8-4624-9d5c-d1810e4c925c" facs="#m-1a8afb18-5d80-4045-9b7c-6aa6325a861e" label="lyrics-like">Offertory. Véritas méa. p. 1203.</l><l xml:id="m-59a9e660-479d-4c15-bc38-bd662ebf1d70" facs="#m-8af0df8a-2965-40a8-a4c7-363c40dcdb5c" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-506e06d6-8191-4cd4-8fa9-06f01d7dafe9" facs="#m-7c41d3ab-2275-4965-9516-ac6402ab2f88" label="lyrics-like">Mnípotens sempitérne Deus, lConfessóris tui atque Pontíficis, ad</l><l xml:id="m-04e044c6-7c28-45ac-8653-9fc5462f3bd0" facs="#m-a6a9aa46-f3f7-4b03-b95b-637eeccd95df" label="lyrics-like">U múnera tuae majestáti obláta, ] perpétuam nobis fac provenire sa¬</l><l xml:id="m-3b843a6d-0534-4880-995f-9f83b41986a0" facs="#m-8aad321f-3ba5-4813-806b-616b3675e6a0" label="lyrics-like">per intercessiónem beáti Ambrósii! lútém. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-0203233c-1b64-4663-a7a5-2ae43e967303" facs="#m-96dd083b-1d14-464e-9d25-d1ca07120313" label="lyrics-like">Communion. Semel jurávi. p. 1132.</l><l xml:id="m-8ecc71b5-e13a-4c40-85d2-9017cfc7e03f" facs="#m-a824e7d9-b181-4285-bd15-f933eecfdc6a" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-729e6398-ed74-4c01-b147-0b0dd19f59d9" facs="#m-7d754199-8d7f-4524-870b-a49adc7ccd33" label="lyrics-like">YAcraménta salútis nostrae susci-I nos ubíque orátio ádjuvet, in cujus</l><l xml:id="m-c306c7ef-156f-4630-aba5-aa06519d0b6c" facs="#m-d2299a98-d683-4dbf-b455-a7f2ed3ea197" label="lyrics-like">O piéntes, concéde, quaésumus veneratióne haec tuae obtúlimus</l><l xml:id="m-e214eefc-b298-4301-a1ee-c130c3e662a8" facs="#m-5a18f138-4184-40be-9459-2f6b8796eb8e" label="lyrics-like">omnipotens Deus : ut beáti Ambró-] majestáti. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-0a4e53ce-8968-4799-a6b4-0dee157e1798" facs="#m-ba7aea2a-3487-43d4-ac64-842ae3a36774" label="lyrics-like">sii Confessóris tui atque Pontificis</l><l xml:id="m-86c18a33-7f5e-4d57-b90d-0944673168f0" facs="#m-750be852-33e5-4aa8-8b23-8ca593aaecaa" label="ambiguous">~=- - cRa</l><l xml:id="m-90f03991-697f-4659-887e-b1f8bfc9929d" facs="#m-8fb3a90a-24f7-4a4f-93d1-f179e18eaf47" label="ambiguous">DECEMBER 8.</l><l xml:id="m-4dc9fc3a-8933-49db-b640-134385c7d931" facs="#m-3f23d08e-4e1c-4f2a-854f-6582e06b3d3c" label="text-like">THE IMMACULATE CONCEPTION</l><l xml:id="m-705ffa39-d643-4f8d-82bc-c1b828e26071" facs="#m-82396e65-ba49-423d-a261-7bafde2e0916" label="text-like">OF THE BLESSED VIRGIN MARY.</l><l xml:id="m-acf267ed-0bc8-4249-b456-4f603fcebdff" facs="#m-b41eebc9-0b4c-4875-9660-4a159abbb5aa" label="text-like">Double of the first class with common Octave.</l><l xml:id="m-daaeca4c-9e5f-4612-be38-1461fa2c263d" facs="#m-e7013ac2-1451-4f1b-8b53-e96f4f4d0502" label="text-like">AT FIRST VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-a4a5a5dd-c5bf-43fb-981e-73edd720f51a" facs="#m-57f091f4-fc97-4870-b43c-4c413d7d0df3" label="text-like">Ail as at second Vespers, p. 1820, except the following:</l><l xml:id="m-5e5e1f6f-3f20-468c-863d-f0d639fbdbb9" facs="#m-0e287528-0f95-4a3c-ad79-f498a26dabac" label="text-like">At Magn.</l><l xml:id="m-2c8292c2-950b-42de-b903-8a0b31185a09" facs="#m-9baee336-cd67-4694-84b2-e12309cd64a6" label="ambiguous">Ant. S. G</l><l xml:id="m-149bbafc-75ab-4c13-ba99-c222817c9ff6" facs="#m-ea0e3abb-6d57-4dae-a9d4-264e5698c32a" label="lyrics-like">D. E-átam me dícent “ómnes gene-ra-ti-ónes,</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>